y the build-pipeline-green acceptance criterion below:\n52\tthe epic is not done until the operator image builds green through that\n53\tpipeline.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- Platform Operator images contain no non-validated cryptographic libraries\n58\t  in the request path (validated modules only).\n59\t- The operator deploys, upgrades, and manages the serving stack correctly on\n60\t  a FIPS-enabled OpenShift cluster (end-to-end functional verification).\n61\t- Build pipeline green: the operator image builds successfully through its\n62\t  Konflux pipeline.\n63\t- License-cleared dependency tree is respected (no new unscanned\n64\t  dependencies introduced by the crypto changes).\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\tHLR-1 — all serving-stack images run correctly on FIPS-enabled clusters using\n69\tvalidated crypto modules (Platform Operator portion).\n70\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-94be516b58889a8f","agent_id":"ada59d30699315282","session_id":"4a043728-3f47-48a2-8b4d-164c061f2c18","uuid":"549392ae-d849-4ccc-82d0-70b22ebba3e2","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:26:06.841Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a761012c8cf7de23","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
