{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a81eb784efbdfb78","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9013-E006\n3\ttitle: CI gating check for FIPS crypto regressions in serving-stack builds\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9013\n5\tcomponent: KServe\n6\tteam: RHOAI Serving\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 1\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 1\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 8\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# CI gating check for FIPS crypto regressions in serving-stack builds\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tA gating CI check that fails any serving-stack build which reintroduces\n34\tnon-validated cryptographic library usage, protecting the remediated FIPS\n35\tbaseline of the serving stack against regressions.\n36\t\n37\t## Scope\n38\t\n39\t- Implement a build-time check (image/dependency scan) that detects\n40\t  non-validated crypto usage in serving-stack image builds.\n41\t- Wire the check as a gating (build-failing, not advisory) step into the\n42\t  serving-stack build pipelines, covering the KServe and Platform Operator\n43\t  build pipelines.\n44\t- Provide a test fixture that demonstrably fails the check (a deliberately\n45\t  non-compliant image).\n46\t\n47\tThis epic is developed in parallel with the serving-stack FIPS remediation —\n48\tthere is deliberately no ordering edge between them. The operational coupling\n49\tis an acceptance criterion below: the check must pass against the remediated\n50\timages, i.e. the gate is enabled on the remediated baseline rather than\n51\tbefore it exists.\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- The check detects non-validated crypto usage in a serving-stack image\n56\t  build and fails that build (verified against a deliberately non-compliant\n57\t  test image).\n58\t- The check passes on serving-stack builds whose images use only validated\n59\t  crypto modules (the remediated baseline).\n60\t- The check is gating in every serving-stack build pipeline it covers — a\n61\t  build with non-validated crypto cannot merge or release.\n62\t\n63\t## HLR Traceability\n64\t\n65\tHLR-3 — CI enforces FIPS regressions: a gating check fails any serving-stack\n66\tbuild that reintroduces non-validated crypto usage.\n67\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-94be516b58889a8f","agent_id":"ada59d30699315282","session_id":"4a043728-3f47-48a2-8b4d-164c061f2c18","uuid":"80d00ab2-0a60-49d4-9bc5-c5baa3e3206b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:26:10.256Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a81eb784efbdfb78","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
