tRisks/Notes and the summary's Health Warnings, and E007's ACs are written at\n201\tthe engineering completion point (assembled, sign-off recorded, submitted and\n202\ttriaged). No epic body references sibling epics by draft ID.\n203\t\n204\t### 7. Completeness (2/2)\n205\t\n206\tAll strategy scope is covered: image remediation (E004/E005), evidence\n207\tpackage and submission (E007), CI enforcement (E006), documentation (E008),\n208\tonboarding for the component missing from architecture context (E001–E003).\n209\tThe out-of-scope boundaries (workbenches/pipelines/training, Common Criteria)\n210\tare carried into E008's content outline. Strategy-level context is not\n211\tdropped: the external schedule constraint is carried as risk on E007 and as\n212\thealth warnings; the missing strategy sections (teams, dependencies, ACs,\n213\tNFRs) are disclosed. Tiered delivery is correctly evaluated (Tier 1\n214\tE001–E006 delivers without the lab; E007 is the externally gated Tier 2), and\n215\tno upstream-PR epic is needed since remediation is carried midstream (Rule 21\n216\tfallback noted in E005's scope). No conditional branches are required — the\n217\tstrategy has no bounded-outcome investigation.\n218\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ac788d1323b72051","agent_id":"a04a8d0d150f0a111","session_id":"4a043728-3f47-48a2-8b4d-164c061f2c18","uuid":"fbb50286-7142-4fa2-8eb6-34c22a9546f0","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:35:43.427Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-85cae8ab4b9eedae","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
