evidence package contains the module inventory, build attestations,\n55\t  and FIPS-mode test results, covering every serving-stack image in scope.\n56\t- The evidence package has been submitted to the security review board;\n57\t  review feedback is addressed and sign-off is recorded.\n58\t- The evidence package has been submitted to the external certification lab\n59\t  and accepted for review (triaged).\n60\t\n61\t## Risks / Notes\n62\t\n63\t- The accredited lab's historical turnaround is six to nine months, and both\n64\t  lab scheduling and review-board cadence are externally controlled — they\n65\t  cannot be compressed by engineering effort. This is schedule risk on the\n66\t  certification outcome, not a deliverable of this epic: the acceptance\n67\t  criteria above are written at the engineering completion point (package\n68\t  assembled, sign-off recorded, submitted and triaged).\n69\t\n70\t## HLR Traceability\n71\t\n72\tHLR-2 — a compliance evidence package (module inventory, build attestations,\n73\ttest results) is assembled and submitted through the security review board to\n74\tthe external certification lab.\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ac788d1323b72051","agent_id":"a04a8d0d150f0a111","session_id":"4a043728-3f47-48a2-8b4d-164c061f2c18","uuid":"a098bff3-3694-452f-baad-94df38d5cb75","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:36:04.079Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-94c52a024ef0e7f0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
