n52\tcoupling is enforced by the build-pipeline-green acceptance criterion below:\n53\tthe epic is not done until the operator image builds green through that\n54\tpipeline. The midstream repository itself is a prerequisite: development of\n55\tthese changes begins once the operator's midstream repository exists.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- Platform Operator images contain no non-validated cryptographic libraries\n60\t  in the request path (validated modules only).\n61\t- The operator deploys, upgrades, and manages the serving stack correctly on\n62\t  a FIPS-enabled OpenShift cluster (end-to-end functional verification).\n63\t- Build pipeline green: the operator image builds successfully through its\n64\t  Konflux pipeline.\n65\t- License-cleared dependency tree is respected (no new unscanned\n66\t  dependencies introduced by the crypto changes).\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\tHLR-1 — all serving-stack images run correctly on FIPS-enabled clusters using\n71\tvalidated crypto modules (Platform Operator portion).\n72\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a1b4f8e1156e58df","agent_id":"ae94751e2b2cffef3","session_id":"4a043728-3f47-48a2-8b4d-164c061f2c18","uuid":"e53a5c00-69cf-4e85-a8bd-97968f646281","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:39:12.270Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-88c35b5bd137588a","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
